FILE: config.py
PURPOSE: All LLM prompt templates (chart, insights, SQL, metadata, cleanse) and path constants.
IMPORTS: pathlib

KEY SYMBOLS:
  UPLOAD_DIR                   Path("uploads")
  CHART_AND_INSIGHTS_PROMPT    Full prompt requesting both vega_spec + insights JSON
  CHART_ONLY_PROMPT            Prompt requesting vega_spec only
  INSIGHTS_ONLY_PROMPT         Prompt requesting insights only
  (additional prompts for SQL generation, metadata generation, cleanse repair)

NOTE: This is the largest file (300 lines). Editing prompts here affects all LLM behaviour.
